  "intro": "Standalone drill set, not tied to any lesson. Most verbs take haben in the Perfekt — it's the default. sein is the exception, reserved for verbs of MOTION (gehen, kommen, fahren) and CHANGE OF STATE (aufstehen, einschlafen), plus a short list of exceptions (sein, bleiben, werden, passieren). Blocks: A Basistraining (the reference table, then auxiliary-only) → B Vertiefung → C Sprachbausteine → D Wiederholung. Answers in solutions.md.\n",
